#created by Duel Circuit - No Limits: Despia Branded, summer 2026 (Imogen "Albion")
#title Despia Branded (2026, uncut)
#era 2026
#tier No Limits peak build: pool (docs/dev/NO-LIMITS-SPEC-2026-11-02.md section 5)
#about Top 4 at the 2026 European WCQ (2,268 players), in the summer it won thirteen national titles and never the big one. Aluber, Branded Opening and Super Polymerization fuse on both turns, often with the opponent's monsters; Albion the Branded Dragon and Mirrorjade end the turn. No Light and Darkness Ritual package. Here with three Branded Fusion, Branded Expulsion back, and the Chaos cards its LIGHT and DARK grave feeds.
#why Peak list: July 2026; restored: Albion the Branded Dragon (Extra, 2), Branded Fusion x3, Branded in High Spirits x3, Branded Opening x3, Branded Expulsion x2; picks: Eclipse Wyvern, Chaos Sorcerer (the list has 7 LIGHT and 7 DARK monsters and two Albion the Shrouded Dragon for Wyvern, so no Monster Reborn); cuts: Droll & Lock Bird x2, Forbidden Crown x1 (flex). Measured 2026-11-03: rated 1865 (+35 over branded-despia 1830).
#banlist TCG May 2026
#recipe branded-despia
